        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chynna Phillips, John Phillips, Michelle Phillips, Mackenzie Phillips, Bijou Phillips\n- Groups: Wilson Phillips, The Mamas & the Papas\n- Products: Naked and Sacred\n\nFacts:\n- Chynna Phillips left the pop group Wilson Phillips around 1992.\n- Naked and Sacred is Chynna Phillips' debut and only solo album, and it was released in November 1995.\n- John Phillips and Michelle Phillips were band members of The Mamas & the Papas.\n- Chynna Phillips is the daughter of John Phillips and Michelle Phillips.\n- Chynna Phillips is the half-sister of Mackenzie Phillips and Bijou Phillips.",
